{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:53:19+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-11T16:53:19+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"RENK Group AG","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"Germany","city":"Augsburg","website":"https://www.renk.com","employees":4478,"summary":"RENK Group AG engages in the design, engineering, production, testing, and servicing of customized drive systems in Asia, Germany, the United States, Africa, Australia, Oceania, and other European and European Union countries. The company operates through three segments: Vehicle Mobility Solutions, Marine & Industry, and Slide Bearings. It offers single and dual engine gearboxes; marine gearboxes, clutches, and bearings; shaft generators; hybrid and electric, and onboard power grid solutions; transmissions, engines, final drives, suspension systems, and track tension; and electrification and hybrid mobility solutions. The company also provides helical, planetary, integral, vacuum, and clutch gearboxes; variable speed systems; and industrial gearboxes for mills, extruders, and hydropower plants. In addition, it offers slide bearings, couplings, and test systems. The company also provides engineering, condition monitoring, maintenance and modernization, and spare parts management services; mechanical and gear manufacturing, hardening, and metrology services; marine services, including evaluation and design of propulsion system, and power distribution and grid design; design of suspension for military vehicle; and spare parts management, contract manufacturing, and test systems. The company serves military vehicles, marine, civil maritime, cement and plastics production, and oil and gas industries, as well as customers in hydrogen, energy generation, carbon capture, utilization and storage, and industrial heat pump applications. RENK Group AG was founded in 1873 and is headquartered in Augsburg, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"RENK Group AG se consacre à la conception, à l'ingénierie, à la production, aux essais et à l'entretien de systèmes d'entraînement personnalisés en Asie, en Allemagne, aux États-Unis, en Afrique, en Australie, en Océanie et dans d'autres pays d'Europe et de l'Union européenne. La société opère à travers trois segments : les solutions de mobilité des véhicules, la marine et l'industrie, et les roulements à glissière. Il propose des boîtes de vitesses à moteur simple et double, des boîtes de vitesses marines, des embrayages et des roulements, des générateurs d'arbres, des solutions de réseau électrique hybride et électrique et embarqué, des transmissions, des moteurs, des entraînements finaux, des systèmes de suspension et des solutions d'électrification et de mobilité hybride."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":3416999936,"shares_outstanding":100000000,"trailing_pe":34.51515,"forward_pe":16.469692,"price_to_book":7.2733073,"ev_to_ebitda":17.378,"ev_to_revenue":2.803,"dividend_yield":0.0162,"payout_ratio":0.8286,"beta_yahoo":2.377},"targets":{"current_price":34.17,"mean":58.58824,"median":60.0,"high":75.5,"low":42.0,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":1.52941,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":0.78968,"eps_low":0.75935,"eps_high":0.82,"revenue_avg":543195080,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-11","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.1003,"institutions_pct":0.53778,"institutions_float_pct":0.59774,"institutions_n":221,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":418,"value":14283,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.1742}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.013200001,"shares":1316898,"value":44998402,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.1675},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0088,"shares":880697,"value":30093414,"date":"2026-06-